WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.568
Shortlist turns a buying brief and supplier quotes into

00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:09.137
a checked purchase plan. This is the actual app,

00:00:09.137 --> 00:00:13.705
using fictional quotes, real Vultr requests, and shortened model

00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:14.720
waiting time.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.301
A spoken brief asks for one hundred workshop kits,

00:00:19.301 --> 00:00:23.282
a complete budget of five hundred ninety US dollars,

00:00:23.282 --> 00:00:27.264
delivered by November fourteenth. Vultr transcribes it and
proposes

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:30.360
requirements. The buyer reviews and saves them.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.579
Each extracted price links to the exact words in

00:00:38.579 --> 00:00:41.798
the quote. Cedar confirms a delivery delay. The buyer

00:00:41.798 --> 00:00:45.016
corrects the date and locks it. No current offer

00:00:45.016 --> 00:00:47.520
now meets both the budget and deadline.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.597
Cedar sends an updated price and shipping charge. The

00:00:51.597 --> 00:00:55.073
Vultr buying agent reads the original and saves supported

00:00:55.073 --> 00:00:58.550
facts through Agent Native actions. The locked November
eighteenth

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:01.640
delivery date stays unchanged, including after a reload.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.164
Shortlist finds a useful next move. Harbor is five

00:01:10.164 --> 00:01:13.688
dollars over budget. With shipping and tax unchanged, its

00:01:13.688 --> 00:01:17.213
unit price must be five dollars ten cents or

00:01:17.213 --> 00:01:20.737
less. The supplier question draft asks for that revised,

00:01:20.737 --> 00:01:21.520
complete quote.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:26.156
The buyer reviews a budget of five hundred ninety

00:01:26.156 --> 00:01:30.192
five dollars. Harbor now fits. A separate checker recalculates

00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:34.227
the complete cost and checks quantity, currency, delivery,
evidence

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:38.263
and supplier exclusions. The exact plan is ready for

00:01:38.263 --> 00:01:39.160
human review.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.926
The buyer reviews the supplier, complete price, delivery and

00:01:43.926 --> 00:01:48.091
exclusions, then approves this exact plan. The agent cannot

00:01:48.091 --> 00:01:52.257
give that approval. Shortlist can now speak the saved

00:01:52.257 --> 00:01:52.720
decision.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:58.461
Your buying brief is 100 units, a complete budget

00:01:58.461 --> 00:02:03.602
of $595.00, and delivery by 2026-11-14. Harbor Studio is

00:02:03.602 --> 00:02:08.742
the current recommendation at $595.00 in total, arriving
2026-11-12.

00:02:08.742 --> 00:02:13.883
Review these supplier exclusions: Design services are not
included.

00:02:13.883 --> 00:02:19.024
Your reviewed plan for Harbor Studio is approved. You

00:02:19.024 --> 00:02:21.880
can download its purchase packet.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.775
The approved purchase packet downloads with the original quotes,

00:02:26.775 --> 00:02:31.070
source evidence, corrections and independent checks. It carries
the

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:35.366
exact plan fingerprint, so the reviewed decision can be

00:02:35.366 --> 00:02:36.320
inspected later.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:40.766
Now the supplier increases shipping. The old approval is

00:02:40.766 --> 00:02:44.613
cleared and a fresh review is required. Undo restores

00:02:44.613 --> 00:02:48.459
the quote but cannot restore that approval. The buyer

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:52.305
can also revoke agent writes while reading and comparisons

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.160
remain available.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:57.554
Shortlist brings the buying brief, evidence, workable options
and

00:02:57.554 --> 00:03:01.348
reviewed purchase plan together. The agent helps with the

00:03:01.348 --> 00:03:04.720
work, and the buyer controls the saved decision.
